<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n47548" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠρῐ-γένεια</span></b> , ἡ,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἦρι, γενέσθαι</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>early-born, child of morn</i>, epith. of
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἠώς</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				4.195
			</span></i>, etc.: also abs.,= <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἠώς</span>,
				<i><span class="en">
				22.197
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				23.347
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καθαρᾶς ἅπερ
			ἠριγενείας</span> as at clear <i>morn</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				24.39
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γενέθλιον ἠριγένειαν</span> a
			birthday <i>morning,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				AP
				9.353
			</span></i> (Leon.<i><span class="en">
				Alex.
			</span></i>); later, epith. of the Moon, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Hymn.Mag.</u>
				5.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> in later 
				Ep.
			, <i>a day</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Nonn.
				<u>D.</u>
				38.271
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Q.S.
				10.478
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔαρ</span>) <i>bearing in spring</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λέαινα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					426
				</span></i>
			 (nisi leg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠυγ-</span>).</div>
